Save the file. As you've done in previous weeks, open a terminal and execute `npm run dev` to start the development server.

When you check your browser at [localhost:5173](http://localhost:5173). You should see a button with our title and a right arrow. Click it, and the methodology text appears. Click again, and it disappears.

